  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\n$I_{1}=1.51_{2}$\r\n$\\frac{\\left.\\right|_{1}}{I_{2}}=\\frac{3}{2} \\cdot \\quad \\frac{l_{\\max }}{I_{\\min }}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{L_{1}}+\\sqrt{L_{2}}}{\\sqrt{I_{1}}-\\sqrt{L_{2}}}\\right)^{2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^{2}=98$"
